menu "InduLogger M2.2 demo switches"

    config COPROC_SUPPRESS_ACK
        bool "Never transmit ACK frames (acceptance #4: force retransmit/fault chain)"
        default n
        help
            Link still RX-parses and the session still generates ACKs;
            this build simply drops them on the wire so the STM32 side
            must show retry x3 -> fault -> link DOWN.

    config COPROC_LOOPBACK_DEMO
        bool "Send a PING every 2 s (GPIO11->GPIO12 loopback self-test)"
        default n
        help
            For M2.2a hardware self-test only, no STM32 involved.

endmenu
